// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ArchitectGreeterDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ArchitectIntro Text :
"P689494192" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>Hi, {HeroName}, and welcome to Architect Entertainment, where we make your dreams a reality.<br><br>I'm here to help direct you to the various features of our facility.<br><br>Is there something specific you're looking for?"
// Answer Text :
"P2623031041" "What is Architect Entertainment?"
// Answer Text :
"P453804626" "Architect Entertainment Locations"
// Answer Text :
"P2083823924" "How do I get started?"
// Answer Text :
"P1985805217" "Do I earn rewards while in Mission Architect?"
// Answer Text :
"P1961968658" "Does Architect Entertainment police created content?"
// Answer Text :
"P884293184" "Where can I get further instruction about the Mission Architect?"
// Page WhatIsArchitect Text :
"P2922095387" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>Architect Entertainment is a company founded by Dr. Aeon, CEO and Chief Visionary of Aeon Corp. With his futuristic ideas and the financial support of Crey Industries, the Architect Entertainment Corporation has come to life for your enjoyment. What you see around you is the culmination of years of scientific research and hard work.<br><br>Here at Architect Entertainment we allow you, {HeroName}, to create your own virtual adventures. When you're ready to show your arc to the world, you can publish it up to our powerful <color deepskyblue>Arc Server</color>. This will share your arc with every other Architect Entertainment facility from Paragon City to the Rogue Isles. Yes, that's right, heroes and villains can enjoy the same adventures."
// Answer Text :
"P2838854197" "I have another question."
// Page GettingStarted Text :
"P1713940428" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>To get started using the Mission Architect, simply take the elevator up to the main studio and access one of the Mission Architect computers. From there you will be able to make your own missions, or 'arcs' as we call them, as well as play other arcs created by players."
// Page ArchitectLocations Text :
"P745008711" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>You can find an <color deepskyblue>Architect Enetertainment</color> building in the following areas of Paragon City and the Rogue Isles.<br><br><table border="1"><tr><td><b><color deepskyblue>Paragon City<br></color></b>Atlas Park<br>Brickstown<br>Faultline<br>Founders Falls<br>Independence Port<br>Kings Row<br>Peregrine Island<br>Rikti War Zone<br>Skyway City<br>Steel Canyon<br>Talos Island</td><td><b><color red>Rogue Isles</color></b><br>Cap Au Diable<br>Mercy Island<br>Nerva Archipelago<br>Port Oakes<br>St. Martial<br>Sharkhead Isle</td></tr></table>"
// Page ArchitectTickets Text :
"P3491117808" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>While playing in our Architect virtual world, you'll gain experience as well as what we call <color deepskyblue>Architect Tickets</color>. You can use these tickets to buy various rewards in our Architect Store. Oh, and you can find those stores upstairs as well."
// Page ArchitectPolice Text :
"P663877545" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>Here at Architect Entertainment we want to allow people to bring their imagination to life. However in the interest of professionalism and quality we do monitor all content being generated. All published missions are peer reviewed by other architects as well as our crack team of customer service representatives. If content is found to be inappropriate then we will take action. This could be something as minor as forcing the architect to rewrite his/her arc, to removing the arc from our <color deepskyblue>Arc Server</color> or even as severe as banning the person from using the architect altogether."
// Page ArchitectInstruction Text :
"P46122705" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>I'm just the greeter. If you want more detailed instruction regarding the tools and features of the Architect please speak with a <color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Instructor</color>, located upstairs in the main lobby or in the architect 'studio B'."
// Page ArchitectMoreHelp Text :
"P92567050" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>Is there anything else I can help you with, {HeroName}?"
// Page Fallback Text :
"P4171274161" "<color deepskyblue>Architect Entertainment Greeter</color><br><br>um? What was I saying?"
// DisplayName for N_ArchitectGreeter :
"P3724941264" "Architect Entertainment Greeter"
